From cf0bc62e8b85d9bb76c3f1ad0de1f5e072995a7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:22:11 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Optimization pass: 477 KB more free RAM, less idle polling
 (w99s)

Kernel: old DS Wi-Fi (NDS_WIFI, ARM7 wifi.o under #ifdef), NET_RADIO, INET_DIAG,
MTD_CHAR, HWMON and the PC RTC off; DLDI stub only without DSISD; camera frame
buffers and 3D texture staging allocated on demand. ROM: retired boot scripts,
net-tools arp/route (busybox route), busybox vi/time/syslogd/telnetd/dos2unix/
ipcalc removed; /boot program data compressed. Idle: dsautolog 10 s tick, battery
60 s, log saves at most once a minute / every 30 min; dsdesk 1 s idle wait;
ARM7 single touch read when up, volume 2.5 Hz; no repeated ARM7 request on
/proc/dsisettings EOF; no empty Wi-Fi rx copy; health check 30 s; logbody drops
the DS chip probes. Start menu: Bench, 3D Dodge, Tetris, Game Boy removed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
